sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant TG as Telegram
 participant Bot
 participant FSM as Диалог
 participant LLM
 participant SQL as PostgreSQL
 participant Поиск
 participant Out as Outbox Sender
 User->>TG: Request or changed constraints
 TG->>Bot: update_id
 Bot->>SQL: Durable inbox, unique update_id
 Bot-->>TG: 2xx ACK
 Bot->>FSM: Serialize by chat; increment generation
 FSM->>LLM: Extract intent and slots only
 LLM-->>FSM: Untrusted structured slots
 FSM->>FSM: Validate hard/soft/unspecified
 alt Clarification needed, count less than 2
  FSM->>Out: Persist bounded clarification
 else Ready
  FSM->>Поиск: ПоискRequest and generation
  Поиск->>SQL: SQL eligibility on occurrence/offer/version
  Поиск->>SQL: FTS and pgvector on eligible set
  Поиск->>Поиск: RRF, rerank, canonical diversity
  Поиск->>SQL: Revalidate and check generation
  Поиск-->>FSM: Up to 3 RecommendationКандидат
  FSM->>Out: Durable ДоставкаIntent with TTL
  Out->>SQL: Recheck version, freshness, exclusions, generation
  alt Valid
   Out->>TG: sendMessage
   TG-->>Out: ACK or ambiguous timeout
   Out->>SQL: Delivered + impression on confirmed ACK only
  else Stale
   Out->>SQL: Cancel intent
  end
 end
